    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1771</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200003e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>無事に抜けたようだな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Parece que saímos ilesos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1815</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200003f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もう、コワくないからね、&lt;Annie&gt;。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não precisa mais ter medo,
&lt;Annie&gt;♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1837</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000040</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1871</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000041</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ペトナジャンカはこの先だな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Petnadjanka está perto?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1908</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000042</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、森を抜けるのに、
ずいぶん手間取ってしまった。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sim, embora a travessia por
estes bosques tenha custado
tempo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1949</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000043</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Blue&gt;王の盾&lt;White&gt;は、ずっと先に
行ってしまったかもしれない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O &lt;Blue&gt;Escudo Real&lt;White&gt; deve estar
bem à frente de nós a essa hora...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1976</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000044</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>例えそうだとしても、
ペトナジャンカで、
連中の足取りをつかめる
可能性は高い。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ainda assim, é provável que
consigamos alcançá-los em
Petnadjanka.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2004</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000045</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく……急ごう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então vamos logo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>-1</PointerOffset>
