    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2095</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;奥義&lt;Green&gt;が習得可能になりました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Agora é possível aprender &lt;Red&gt;Fusion Forces&lt;Green&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;奥義の習得は
&lt;Red&gt;術技&lt;Green&gt;メニューから
設定を行えます。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Você pode aprender e usar
Fusion Forces no
&lt;Red&gt;Menu de Force&lt;Green&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
